  "title": "Ex 9.28 · Do a | b and b | a force a = b?",
  "prompt": "Statement: for all integers $a$ and $b$, if $a \\mid b$ and $b \\mid a$, then $a = b$. This statement is false. Disprove it with a counterexample.",
